    "doc_text": "XIN_ENG_20061102.0263\n\nPARIS, Nov. 2 , 2006 (Xinhua)\n\nChirac meets with Talabani in Presidential Palace\n\n\n\n\nFrench President Jacques Chirac met with his Iraqi counterpart Jalal Talabani Thursday afternoon in the Presidential palace l'Elysee.\n\nAccompanied by four ministers, Talabani arrived in Paris Wednesday afternoon for a three-day official visit. It is the second visit of an Iraqi president to France since 2003.\n\nIn a speech in the French Institute of International Relations earlier the day, Talabani expressed his wishes to build up a new momentum in France-Iraq relations.\n\nDuring the meeting, Chirac and Talabani are to discuss the situation in Iraq, the French Presidential office said.",
